" outlines the steps, tools and support available for migrating to "
"PostgreSQL. See more details in `this forum post "
"<https://forum.mattermost.com/t/transition-to-postgresql/19551>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/product-overview/deprecated-features.rst:42
msgid ""
